      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `235c2638531272d18b0122475514ebcc6f615e89673e1e6bcb84ef4ae2321893--prisoners-australia-2024-federal-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Prisoners in Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2024\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | e3e520c4c5ea73864c89836dd1e52fda19e1ae6ba0213851cd6e5c9656ba0b72 | missing |\n| \"Table 36\" | 26290262016edcfd6b42a7d73514ab5722c0433580e409c4d085173f18793c80 | missing |\n| \"Table 37\" | 80d3252b32886575d9eda86990c4e9de90beae7b58076084af70d4fb3b7cd426 | missing |\n| \"Table 38\" | 4dbcdde359c30464e248c7948fa312fe9fd5ede9947461d72c61dd45dea24800 | missing |\n| \"Table 39\" | 6666d49fa4c23e648d17fc992c9536c318fcf575f0ade33e6298c1e999e0a696 | missing |\n| \"Further information\" | 67498a8e9b09b4681cc9fa33b4e6140a414fed5a96067cff81056779f762b4dc | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- A normalized copy of this workbook exists (cc84df5591282fea5380980b17cce94e3700bdf3ec798b3d2c7aa739de2b5c63). Layout should match.\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
